<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia posts $590.5 mln trade surplus in April.</title>
<headline>Indonesia posts $590.5 mln trade surplus in April.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia posted a trade surplus of $590.5 million in April against $243.3 million in March, a government official said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>The official said exports totalled $4,153.5 million and imports were $3,563.0, with oil and gas exports amounting to $968.5 million in April.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
